commit c5849b4c98f65f0c207eed257292e1a6c7f25359
Author: Arkadiusz Kusztal <arkadiuszx.kusztal@intel.com>
Date:   Tue Jun 20 10:32:33 2023 +0000

    test/crypto: remove obsolete test function
    
    Removed function `one by one` as it was not enough
    scalable and robust.
    
    Signed-off-by: Arkadiusz Kusztal <arkadiuszx.kusztal@intel.com>
    Acked-by: Ciara Power <ciara.power@intel.com>
    Acked-by: Gowrishankar Muthukrishnan <gmuthukrishn@marvell.com>

