@@ -3016,13 +3016,14 @@ following sections.
 - Create a flow rule::
 
    flow create {port_id}
-       [group {group_id}] [priority {level}] [ingress] [egress] [transfer]
-       pattern {item} [/ {item} [...]] / end
+       [group {group_id}] [priority {level}] [ingress] [egress]
