commit 5b2a7f12edcaba0daab0154c9ab03430083cfd80
Author: Dongdong Liu <liudongdong3@huawei.com>
Date:   Mon Jun 26 20:43:04 2023 +0800

    config/arm: add HiSilicon HIP10
    
    Adding support for HiSilicon HIP10 platform.
    
