commit 34a737d109cde48c8acffb67b41ff4ed2562f0f3
Author: Sunil Kumar Kori <skori@marvell.com>
Date:   Thu Jun 15 18:39:23 2023 +0530

    net/cnxk: support backpressure on SPB pool
    
    With current implementation, backpressure can be configured only
    on LPB pool but a RQ can be configured SPB pool too and
    SPB pool can also participate to assert backpressure.
    
    Enabling backpressure support on SPB pool for 802.3x and 802.1qbb.
    
    Signed-off-by: Sunil Kumar Kori <skori@marvell.com>

diff --git a/drivers/net/cnxk/cnxk_ethdev_ops.c b/drivers/net/cnxk/cnxk_ethdev_ops.c
