commit 4a06eacb18c3598f036237c616054651da3d97c7
Author: Ivan Malov <ivan.malov@arknetworks.am>
Date:   Wed Jun 7 17:02:39 2023 +0400

    net/sfc: rename structs used by transfer flow counters
    
    Doing so facilitates rearrangements of the next patch needed
    to make software counter objects shareable across many flows.
    
    Signed-off-by: Ivan Malov <ivan.malov@arknetworks.am>
    Reviewed-by: Andy Moreton <amoreton@xilinx.com>
    Acked-by: Andrew Rybchenko <andrew.rybchenko@oktetlabs.ru>

