commit ba49b32e0229a42bc6feef80c45bcf2f8a0fec0a
Author: Qiming Yang <qiming.yang@intel.com>
Date:   Thu May 18 15:16:33 2023 +0000

    net/ice/base: check VSIG before disassociating VSI
    
    Add checking if the VSIG group exists when iterating through all
    flow profiles and disassociating them from the VSI.
    
    Signed-off-by: Benjamin Mikailenko <benjamin.mikailenko@intel.com>
