commit 8881cf1c09446fcc0eefb64decb51657c05bb572
Author: Nithin Dabilpuram <ndabilpuram@marvell.com>
Date:   Thu May 25 15:28:57 2023 +0530

    common/cnxk: avoid inline dev CPT LF detach multiple times
    
    CPT LF detach is done along with all other LF's of inline
    device. Hence remove it from nix_inl_cpt_release().
    Also provide ROC API for setup and release of CPT LF
    separately.
    
    Signed-off-by: Nithin Dabilpuram <ndabilpuram@marvell.com>

