commit fc756151a5bee41101acc7e95cc896ca901107d5
Author: Chaoyong He <chaoyong.he@corigine.com>
Date:   Mon Apr 10 19:00:13 2023 +0800

    net/nfp: move NFDk logic to own file
    
    Split out the data structure and logics of NFDk into new file. The code
    is moved verbatim, no functional change.
    
    Signed-off-by: Chaoyong He <chaoyong.he@corigine.com>
    Reviewed-by: Niklas Söderlund <niklas.soderlund@corigine.com>

