commit ffe84fcbb676a5e2bd8fba832781a8f2686a512d
Author: Chaoyong He <chaoyong.he@corigine.com>
Date:   Mon Apr 10 19:00:10 2023 +0800

    net/nfp: move NFD3 logic to own file
    
    Split out the data struct and logics of NFD3 into new file. The code is
    moved verbatim, no functional change.
    
    Signed-off-by: Chaoyong He <chaoyong.he@corigine.com>
    Reviewed-by: Niklas Söderlund <niklas.soderlund@corigine.com>

