Author: Pavan Nikhilesh <pbhagavatula@marvell.com>
Date:   Wed Apr 26 01:21:10 2023 +0530

    app/eventdev: prevent mempool exhaustion
    
    Prevent mempool exhaustion due to elements being stuck in lcore
    local caches.
    
    Signed-off-by: Pavan Nikhilesh <pbhagavatula@marvell.com>
    Acked-by: Shijith Thotton <sthotton@marvell.com>

